        "id": "b055000000000001",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "BNO055",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "# BNO055 Roll / Pitch / Yaw\n\nDirect acquisition of firmware globals over ST-LINK (SWD).\n\n1. Select the ST-LINK probe in **myProbe_Out** and **myProbe_In**.\n2. Deploy, open Dashboard, press START Acquisition.\n\nVariable addresses come from build/Debug/STM32F4.elf. Re-check them after changing firmware:\n`arm-none-eabi-nm build/Debug/STM32F4.elf | findstr bno055`"
    },
